You gain [22%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 46% (TL1-5; MP 100)] Nature resistance.

When you deal Acid damage to a creature, you gain a [2.2%, 3.5%, 4.7%, 5.7%, 6.7% (TL1-5)] bonus to Nature damage for [2, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

This damage bonus will improve up to 4 times (no more than once each turn) with later Acid damage you do, up to a maximum of [5.0%, 7.9%, 11%, 13%, 15% (TL1-5)].

The resistance and damage increase improve with your Mindpower.
